    "sentence_translations": [
      "Before Exams and After Exams",
      "",
      "Before the exams …",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Mom, I want to go swimming.",
      "",
      "Mom: No, next week you have exams.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Mom, I want to go and play basketball.",
      "",
      "Mom: No, next week you have exams.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Mom, I want to go on a trip with my friends.",
      "",
      "Mom: Don’t even think about it. Wait until after your exams, then we can talk.",
      "",
      "After the exams …",
      "",
      "Mom: Son, let’s go swimming.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: I don’t want to go. I want to rest.",
      "",
      "Mom: Then let’s go and play basketball.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Play basketball? I’m busy watching TV.",
      "",
      "Mom: I remember you wanted to go on a trip with your friends, right?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: I’m not going. I’m not going. We just want to stay home and play on our phones.",
      "",
      "Mom: That’s not what you said in the past.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: The past is the past, the present is the present.",
      ""
